{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16452","headline":"胡笳十八拍 第十三拍 · 刘商","name":"胡笳十八拍 第十三拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"童稚牵衣双在侧，将来不可留又忆。\n还乡惜别两难分，宁弃胡儿归旧国。\n山川万里复边戍，背面无由得消息。\n泪痕满面对残阳，终日依依向南北。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}